## 1. Role and primary objective

Act as a world-class full-stack software engineer, senior UI/UX designer, AI engineer, motion designer, product architect, database engineer and quality assurance specialist.

Build a complete, production-ready AI-powered career navigation and personalized learning platform named **SkillPath AI**, developed by **Nexora Studios**.

**Tagline:** Your ambition. Your roadmap. Your future.

The platform must help users discover careers, understand required skills, generate personalized learning roadmaps, find educational resources, build practical projects and track their professional development.

Do not create a generic AI chatbot, template-based SaaS dashboard or nonfunctional prototype.

Build a fully integrated application with exceptional visual quality, meaningful functionality, smooth interactions and persistent user data.

---

## 2. Core concept

SkillPath AI should turn any career ambition into a structured, achievable and personalized journey.

For example, a user enters:

"I want to become an AI engineer, but I don't know where to start."

The platform should generate:

- Personalized career roadmap.
- Required technical and interpersonal skills.
- Recommended learning resources.
- Beginner, intermediate and advanced learning stages.
- Interactive skill tree.
- Practical projects.
- Estimated learning duration.
- Weekly learning schedule.
- Career opportunities.
- Skill assessments.
- AI-powered guidance.
- Progress tracking.

Support hundreds of career paths, including artificial intelligence, software development, medicine, architecture, entrepreneurship, game development, robotics, cybersecurity, graphic design, engineering and other professional fields.

Career recommendations must remain flexible and should never imply that a user has only one suitable career.

